{"lines":[{"w":0.21810699462890626,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.65020576175374212,"y":0.097383720772280413},{"w":0.33950617472330724,"h":0.020377940929399374,"y":0.1409883718909648,"x":0.084362138698211214,"c":1,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 2"},{"y":0.17726737341682719,"w":0.65226338704427089,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score.","x":0.084362133524648192,"h":0.016046580212416672,"c":1},{"w":0.75118942260742183,"h":0.020885719146548798,"c":1,"y":0.20036546630566643,"t":"Todays technologies enable us to read book on electronic devices and what's more, we can store","x":0.084273281870396399},{"x":0.084240150870145664,"t":"hundreds of thousands of books on devices like Amazon's kindle e-reader. This makes some people","h":0.020939286662215228,"y":0.21836100470075781,"w":0.78213867187499986,"c":1},{"w":0.73251027425130211,"t":"to believe that people will stop printing books and in the future, everything will be digitalized.","x":0.082304535765295367,"y":0.2396937571072415,"h":0.020612485276796155,"c":1},{"y":0.26737338053645865,"c":1,"t":"Electronic books and newspapers have many advantages. They are easy to use and rech. They can","w":0.76131688435872391,"h":0.017510340547954861,"x":0.086419747009419443},{"h":0.019140164899882239,"y":0.28621908100809978,"t":"be stored in computers, mobiles, e-readers and in cloud in huge amounts and are available at any","x":0.084362148282021682,"c":1,"w":0.77777776082356753},{"x":0.084362159868706502,"w":0.74691355387369784,"c":1,"t":"time. The cost of manufacturing and printing is completely removed, which reduced their price.","y":0.3052325582951888,"h":0.018972388987546829},{"w":0.75514404296875004,"c":1,"t":"Digital book and newspapers also have one very important advantage - they are environmentally","x":0.084362134794923618,"y":0.32412790736585162,"h":0.018922740635237134},{"x":0.084285836270065223,"c":1,"h":0.02135204791461065,"t":"friendly. No paper is used to print magazines and books, which means less trees are cut from our","w":0.77172932942708328,"y":0.34300182958465519},{"x":0.082304526011181836,"t":"forests to produce papers. All of these factors convinced many people that digital versions of books","w":0.78189300537109374,"h":0.018898772968701127,"y":0.36336866849724925,"c":1},{"x":0.084362140752833117,"h":0.017476100382450954,"c":1,"y":0.38368669046784809,"w":0.49382715861002613,"t":"and magazines is more convenient, ethical and cheaper choice."},{"x":0.084362133845976739,"y":0.40988372131942463,"t":"On the other hand, traditional printed books and magazines have existed for centuries and I believe","w":0.76131688435872391,"h":0.018895348053517669,"c":1},{"x":0.084362131966839796,"t":"they have created some kind of emotional connection and value for people. When a man reads a book","y":0.42873969375482646,"w":0.77366256713867188,"h":0.017481236631934904,"c":1},{"h":0.018984372259169158,"c":1,"t":"and he likes it, he most probably would like to have it in a form of a tangible thing. Books are a form","x":0.084362140077565942,"y":0.44758539478671988,"w":0.77572016398111976},{"y":0.46790341562361126,"w":0.74897120157877606,"t":"of art, like statues and paintings. You can have a picture of some famous painting, but the painting","x":0.084362135722734682,"h":0.019140164899882128,"c":1},{"h":0.018970675968309481,"x":0.084362151090010121,"y":0.48691860503953521,"w":0.75925923665364581,"t":"itself has some intangible value. Magazines and newspapers do not have such a value in themselves.","c":1},{"y":0.512956419470736,"h":0.019140164899882128,"t":"Based on this, I believe that the amount of books are printed will decrease considerably and maybe","w":0.77777776082356764,"x":0.086419761457545222,"c":1},{"x":0.084362151120656301,"h":0.017512052443900861,"t":"even dramatically, however printed, tangible books will still be demanded by many people as they","y":0.53343023239882859,"w":0.75925923665364592,"c":1},{"x":0.084362134788745213,"t":"have some aura and value in addition to the things that are written inside.","y":0.55232558178378388,"w":0.5884773763020833,"h":0.018934723906859685,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"I do think, though, that there is a big chance magazines and newspapers will move into the online","x":0.084362150113438852,"w":0.76543207804361979,"h":0.018979236571331048,"y":0.57848837248063245},{"c":1,"y":0.59738372131878659,"t":"world completely. This is because they are published in huge numbers daily and weekly and monthly","x":0.084362130059975685,"w":0.78600824991861984,"h":0.018929588219021465},{"c":1,"y":0.61773255852869668,"h":0.018898772968701016,"t":"and no one needs them after years. Printing so huge amount of articles will demand additional","x":0.084362127572737977,"w":0.74691360473632817},{"c":1,"w":0.52057612101236972,"x":0.084362145166700819,"y":0.63662790736328223,"t":"recources and make them less competitive even in terms of price.","h":0.01889534805351778},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.91715116263226448,"t":"131","x":0.83127572055873167,"w":0.034979422887166267,"c":1},{"w":0.074074071248372286,"y":0.96075581383151454,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.30000001192092896,"t":"MunosdTERE","x":0.88271605091902383}],"w":2400,"h":3395}